{"pages":[{"w":612,"ocr":false,"segs":[["FOLLOW-UP THREE: YOUR NEW LIFE IN THE SPIRIT",193.7689,174.94540000000006,581.00890000000004,198.25540000000001,21,false],["CLASSIC FOLLOW-UP SERIES",308.90000000000003,230.46109999999999,436.64000000000004,251.00109999999995,20,false],["This is how the Basic Follow-up Series looked way back in the day—",310.50200000000001,250.07609999999988,567.96500000000015,262.47809999999993,9,false],["back when computers apparently looked like this:",308.90000000000003,263.07609999999988,496.57700000000006,275.47809999999993,9,false],["And yet it’s still effective and still the material of choice for some",308.90000000000003,406.0761,554.68100000000015,418.47809999999998,9,false],["staff and students. After going through the lesson, treat your disciple",308.90000000000003,419.0761,567.32600000000014,431.47809999999998,9,false],["to a nickel root beer and a rousing game of pong.",308.90000000000003,432.0761,489.7820000000001,444.47809999999998,9,false],["YO U R N E W L I F E I N T H E S P I R I T 1",43.841199999999994,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,626.81470000000002,9,false],["YO U R N E W L I F E I N C H R I S T 1",43.841199999999994,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,622.57960000000003,9,false]],"h":792},{"segs":[["3",534.92481208729953,19.569768155374284,556.78195472645973,47.197673428811818,22.102324218750027,false],["Your New Life",320.95488942666816,49.499999237972347,557.93233083291818,80.581395722347352,24.865117187500005,false],["in the Spirit",344.94180744608184,81.870260972123006,558.10330646951934,120.73438908491605,31.091302490234433,false],["Remember: In order to experience God's love and forgiveness you must confess",93.18045403747638,150.79999963215499,514.21805169372635,164.79999963215505,11.200000000000045,false],["your sin as you become aware of it, and turn again to your heavenly Father.",100.08271268337045,165.5999999645145,507.31579373805801,179.59999996451447,11.199999999999978,false],["An amazing transformation has begun to take place since you received Christ as your Lord and",88.515875223288276,217.02290461216438,491.2595519811008,231.61207850132445,11.671339111328052,false],["Savior.",88.578947694825686,229.08139567109376,118.48872247509911,238.2906974289063,7.3674414062500322,false],["You are now beginning to live the Christian life, which isn't a standard of performance nor a code of",86.27819985417068,250.79999986909399,509.61652993229563,263.61627908967512,10.253023376464899,false],["ethics, but a vital personal relationship with a loving God.",86.278196572159317,262.4000001791174,326.70676102528432,274.00000017911736,9.2799999999999727,false],["Read John 7:37-39.",104.68421109804099,315.41860460536253,189.81203092225974,326.93023256556762,9.2093023681640727,false],["Unfortunately, not every believer experiences the power to live this life as God intended.",86.278203973836838,337.19999980818267,456.69924889571183,350.00000018965244,10.240000305175819,false],["Just as our relationship with God is totally dependent on what God has done through Jesus Christ, so",86.278211227811113,359.16279062172475,516.51878739968606,370.79999994179309,9.3097674560546704,false],["the power to live a dynamic Christian life also comes totally from God.",86.278206402966319,369.52325566453999,385.37593589515382,382.18604634447166,10.13023254394534,false],["This computer has",87.428573310416169,430.39999990772105,167.95488556627555,440.89534864734503,8.396278991699182,false],["all the potential",87.428572254673114,443.1976744131124,151.84962328006372,452.40697693386443,7.3674420166016263,false],["to do what it was",86.278196048935641,453.55813984084074,158.75187768956064,461.61627887892661,6.4465112304686958,false],["created to do, but",431.39097909692794,430.39999992881712,509.61654062036547,442.04651176963745,9.3172094726562591,false],["it has no power of",431.39097752425937,440.80000023308457,510.76691746566553,453.59999985161483,10.239999694824201,false],["its own.",431.39097753635178,452.39999997074557,467.05263219943771,462.79999997074555,8.3199999999999825,false],["Similarly, through your new identity in Christ, you have all the potential you need to live as a new crea-",85.127815832859497,516.80000037119828,517.66917325473446,529.59999998972853,10.239999694824201,false],["tion in Christ.",83.977443770534236,528.38372124289617,142.64661491311236,537.60000008200745,7.3730230712890261,false],["But, you must continually draw from the proper Source of power.",87.428578947932138,550.25581429204442,362.36842269793209,560.79999993047215,8.4353485107421875,false],["1",87.428571388916396,592.84883708634743,105.83458640356483,618.17441844621067,20.260465087890591,false],["THE HOLY SPIRIT IS THE POWER SOURCE OF THE",110.43609141271737,590.40000027047131,463.60149668615486,604.40000027047131,11.200000000000001,false],["CHRISTIAN LIFE",113.88721673673345,605.51162839036158,227.77443597501468,619.32558102708037,11.051162109375037,false],["Who is He?",103.50000154225322,631.81683010481981,155.33458406178448,642.52037929915571,8.5628393554687143,false],["Read 2 Corinthians 3:17,18",102.38345771620071,647.99999988348361,220.87217841932568,658.46511600286829,8.3720928955077394,false]],"w":612,"h":792,"ocr":true},{"h":841.67999999999995,"w":612,"segs":[["Why did He come?",103.8323375688377,46.404410628257835,190.56287345750957,57.605475267041157,8.9608517110266579,false],["1. To glorify Christ (John 16:14).",102.61078018905172,61.168604857373388,244.31137833358295,73.402325326249851,9.7869763751011707,false],["2. To lead you into all truth (John 16:13).",103.83233633494811,72.006843969054046,280.95808096385429,83.207908607837268,8.960851711026578,false],["3. To dwell in you (Romans 8:9).",103.832336226359,83.189302792998618,243.08981913651522,94.199651062385058,8.8082786155091526,false],["4. To convict the world of sin and justice (John 16:8).",101.38922708233994,92.808821603662551,332.26347024640245,106.43337174736497,10.899640114961938,false],["What part does the Holy Spirit play in your relationship with God?",103.83233515117881,116.22034900671872,398.22754999492884,128.45406947559528,9.7869763751012453,false],["Read Romans 8:14-16.",103.83233858238439,133.21266146651973,200.33532930504063,142.01349796842095,7.0406692015209735,false],["What does He desire to produce in your life?",102.61077899707151,170.01615970865734,299.28143329394652,181.21722434744058,8.9608517110265904,false],["Read Galatians 5:22,23.",102.6107802434295,185.95255809517374,202.77844381764825,195.73953492808207,7.8295814663266583,false],["How do you think these qualities of God's character (fruit of the Spirit) will grow in your life?",101.38922353568482,215.22045637852301,514.27545400443501,227.6216350857473,9.9209429657794317,false],["Read John 15:4,5.",101.38922320726515,232.42209120151935,180.79041949632764,242.42304177186162,8.0007604562738148,false],["What does Jesus say we are to do in order to see this fruit produced in us?",100.16765876306145,269.14186068843742,432.43113532556146,282.59895335680392,10.765674134693199,false],["Which of these qualities would you most like God to begin developing within you?",101.38922438105159,304.42893533217557,471.5209626623016,316.85337178894287,9.9395491654138368,false],["What does He desire to equip you to do?",101.38922110613004,342.43254737688596,282.17963858659874,354.83372608411031,9.9209429657794779,false],["Read Acts 1:8",101.37390238016214,358.3626206943224,162.48238626688089,369.54377453559493,8.9449230730180265,false],["What is a witness?",101.38922415168295,390.25569750546066,186.89820242316733,401.26604653785904,8.8082792259187048,false],["What does it mean to you to be a witness for Christ?",101.28428142671295,420.77486584275846,336.05703533296293,437.82928147805961,13.643532508240924,false],["Why do you think the Holy Spirit's power is needed to be a witness?",101.38922778008981,457.54116313635598,404.3353215300898,470.99825580472248,10.765674134693199,false],["Summary:",100.09926700513027,497.60936970590814,147.87678165356775,509.22586308207076,9.2931947009300995,false],["A",100.16766490618321,539.50709287468726,111.16167659441561,550.51744190708575,8.8082792259187954,false],["U",100.16766485965455,561.52779073487147,109.94011969363892,571.31476756777977,7.8295814663266361,false],["The degree to which these traits are manifested in the life depends",229.65269353810348,539.50709331284281,513.0538898271659,552.96418598120943,10.765674134693292,false],["upon the extent to which the Christian trusts the Lord with every",230.87425371982044,551.65243352581831,500.8383162198204,562.85349816460166,8.960851711026681,false],["detail of his life, and upon his maturity in Christ. One who is only",230.87425779864793,561.52779093570939,506.94610838458544,572.53813920509583,8.8082786155091526,false],["beginning to understand the ministry of the Holy Spirit should not",230.87425331140068,572.4544104934663,509.38921913171316,584.85558920069059,9.9209429657794317,false],["be discouraged if he is not as fruitful as more mature Christians",230.87425887479037,583.54848861930338,500.83832137479038,594.55883688868971,8.808278615509062,false],["who have known and experienced this truth for a longer period.",232.09581611428234,595.65661593624202,500.83832099709491,605.6575665065842,8.0007604562737473,false],["T",100.16766487187007,594.55883760331722,109.94011970585446,605.56918587270366,8.8082786155091526,false],["Y",101.38922175432344,605.56918592874808,109.94011973405976,615.35616276165649,7.8295814663267267,false],["Spiritual",86.646760564021903,616.29470730850915,123.46102448003754,627.87471116294887,9.2640030835517795,false],["Birth",94.059880283025066,627.58988355423185,116.0479036594899,637.37686038714014,7.8295814663266361,false],["TIME",160.02395261919617,616.57953477819115,184.45508970415713,626.36651161109944,7.8295814663266361,false],["2 SPIRISHPOSTIANS ARE NOT EXPERIENCING THE HOLY",84.287426636967979,648.38720937598066,497.17365710571795,677.74813911169372,23.488743788570446,false],["SPIRIT'S POWER",107.49700793827655,665.51441877416062,228.43113879765156,677.74813924303703,9.7869763751011316,false],["You became a Christian through the Holy Spirit's work (John 3:1-8).",102.61077938798179,688.75848880666638,388.45509091141929,700.9922092755429,9.7869763751012222,false],["From that moment you have been indwelt by the Spirit (John 14:16,17).",102.61078981918953,710.77918635081244,407.99999880356455,721.78953462019888,8.8082786155091526,false]],"ocr":true},{"h":841.67999999999995,"w":612,"ocr":true,"segs":[]},{"ocr":true,"h":841.67999999999995,"segs":[],"w":612}]}